  "details": "The recent changes made so where you're not supposed to use Any State is in my opinion not a good decision. \nBefore I could do complicated animations using Extremely small setups while now I need to do setups about 3 to 4 times the sizes and complexity. \nAnother side effect, achieving the same animation/setup now that I had before for my normal gestures, now all have about a .5 second delay despite the timers being set to the minimum. This makes the game feel very clonky and slow.\nI'm not sure if there was some underlaying issue as to why this change was made and if so I'd love to be properly informed.",
